---
<Layout {...meta} mainClass="flex-1">
<nav aria-label="Migas de pan" class="border-b border-border/70 bg-secondary/40"><ol class="mx-auto flex max-w-[72rem] flex-wrap items-center gap-1 px-6 py-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><li><a class="transition-colors hover:text-primary" href="/">Inicio</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3 w-3 shrink-0 opacity-60"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span aria-current="page" class="text-foreground/80">Sectores</span></li></ol></nav><section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[hsl(var(--ink))] text-white"><img src="/img/406653a8-eadd-4ca8-8c1a-6d52aabdbeff.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-20"><div aria-hidden="true" class="grid-lines absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.07]"></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[72rem] px-6 py-16 sm:py-24"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary-foreground/70">Sectores</p><h1 class="mt-4 max-w-[44rem] font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.9rem]">Sectores en los que trabajamos</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-[44rem] text-base leading-relaxed text-white/70 sm:text-lg">Cada sector tiene exigencias distintas: TISAX en automoción, disponibilidad en industria, confidencialidad en ingenierías, PECAL en defensa y proporcionalidad en PYMES.</p></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-[72rem] px-6 py-16 sm:py-20"><div class="grid gap-px overflow-hidden border border-border bg-border sm:grid-cols-2"><a class="group bg-card p-7 transition-colors hover:bg-accent/40" href="/sectores/automocion"><h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Automoción</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Proveedores y fabricantes del sector automoción trabajan bajo exigencias de seguridad de la información que llegan directamente de sus clientes.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary">Ver sector <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="group bg-card p-7 transition-colors hover:bg-accent/40" href="/sectores/industria"><h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Industria</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">En industria, la disponibilidad es el requisito principal: cada parada tiene un coste medible.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary">Ver sector <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="group bg-card p-7 transition-colors hover:bg-accent/40" href="/sectores/pymes"><h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">PYMES</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Sin departamento IT propio, la tecnología suele crecer por acumulación. Ordenarla es la mejor inversión disponible.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary">Ver sector <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="group bg-card p-7 transition-colors hover:bg-accent/40" href="/sectores/defensa"><h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Defensa</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">El sector defensa exige trazabilidad, control de la información y sistemas de calidad alineados con requisitos contractuales exigentes.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary">Ver sector <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="group bg-card p-7 transition-colors hover:bg-accent/40" href="/sectores/ingenierias"><h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Ingenierías</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">El activo principal de una ingeniería es su documentación técnica. Debe estar disponible, versionada y protegida.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-primary">Ver sector <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></section>
</Layout>
